@startuml
title T12-WF04 — AI CRM Follow-up Agent (Sequence)
autonumber
participant "NestJS Scheduler/Domain Service" as SCHED
participant "n8n WF04\nFollow-up" as N8N
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Communication API" as COMM
participant "Email/Message Provider" as PROVIDER

SCHED -> DB: Select due follow-up execution, enrollment, Lead and active step
DB --> SCHED: Authoritative execution context
SCHED -> SCHED: Validate eligibility and render FollowUpStep templates
SCHED -> DB: Persist recipient/subject/message in FollowUpExecution.requestPayload
DB --> SCHED: Persisted execution payload
SCHED -> N8N: POST protected follow-up-execute webhook (executionId, enrollmentId, stepId)
activate N8N
N8N -> N8N: Validate execution identifiers and service identity; no message content
N8N -> COMM: POST /internal/communication/follow-ups/{executionId}/send
note right of COMM
Empty body; X-N8N-API-KEY service identity
and Idempotency-Key equal to executionId
end note
COMM -> DB: Lock FollowUpExecution and load persisted requestPayload
DB --> COMM: Recipient, subject and message
COMM -> DB: Claim CommunicationDelivery (PROCESSING, request hash, attempt)
COMM -> PROVIDER: Send email through backend SMTP transport
PROVIDER --> COMM: Provider message ID or delivery error
COMM -> DB: Persist SENT / RETRYABLE_FAILURE / PERMANENT_FAILURE / UNKNOWN
DB --> COMM: Delivery state persisted
COMM --> N8N: DeliveryResult (status, attempts, providerMessageId, retryable)
N8N --> SCHED: Return DeliveryResult through the original webhook response; no separate callback
SCHED -> DB: Persist FollowUpExecution outcome; advance only after confirmed SENT
DB --> SCHED: Advanced/completed, retry scheduled, or terminal/UNKNOWN outcome
deactivate N8N
note over N8N,COMM
n8n never sends SMTP directly and never owns editable follow-up templates.
FollowUpService renders/persists the message before dispatch. CommunicationService
loads that immutable payload, owns SMTP/idempotency/delivery state, and returns
DeliveryResult synchronously through the original workflow response.
UC06 has no RabbitMQ trigger or asynchronous delivery-result callback. The current
PR #72 export has six functional nodes; WF04 owner remains responsible for the
final 12-node export and runtime acceptance.
end note
@enduml
